  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Han-seob is a detective who will do whatever it takes to solve a case. He deliberately approaches Seong-min, a member of a drug organisation, in order to destroy it. But this guy. Is he really a member of the gang?! Despite Seong-min’s uncharacteristically sloppy behaviour, Han-seob finds himself adoring him. Then, by chance, a USB falls into Seong-min’s hands. It seems to hold the key to solving the case. Unfortunately, the two are being pursued from all directions. “Listen up, we’re running away from here.” Work and love, love and work! Can Han-seob have it both ways?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/forbid_run), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/forbidden_escape)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/forbid_run), Japanese ([Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/forbid_run), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/forbid_run))",
